-- NOTIF-3: a WIOA master case needing staff attention (stalled, rejected document, eligible with
-- no funding request started, or an upcoming appointment reminder) is not a status transition, so
-- reusing CASE_STATUS_CHANGED would be a lie. Generated by hand via `prisma migrate diff` (no
-- local/shadow DB available in this environment, same as CLAUDE.local.md #8's prior migrations) —
-- applied with `prisma migrate deploy`, not `migrate dev`. Scoped to only this value: the diff
-- also reported an unrelated `QuizQuestion.updatedAt` DROP DEFAULT drift already present before
-- this change, deliberately left out of this migration.
ALTER TYPE "NotificationType" ADD VALUE 'WIOA_FOLLOW_UP_NEEDED';
